WEBVTT

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.500
It's the beach!

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.930
Uh, Prez.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.390
Mind explaining what's going on?

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.760
Why didn't you ask earlier?

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.020
We're here to scout out the location for a seaside school trip!

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:21.770
Oh, the event that's going
to be introduced next year?

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.230
But shouldn't it be the teachers' job?

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.480
If it's a teacher you want,
there's one right there.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.820
The principal figured I couldn't do this alone

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.660
and assigned me some help.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.780
The other teachers couldn't make time,

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:38.240
and well, it proves how much
they trust the student council,

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.540
so you should be proud.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.460
Still, why has Amakusa been put in charge of the travel budget?

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.540
Maybe they don't really trust you.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.750
Who cares?

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.840
We should be thanking our lucky stars
we get to go on a trip for free!

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.050
We didn't come here to have fun, you know.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.850
But hey, we can at least
take pictures together, right?

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:57.720
Snap one, Taka-nii!

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:58.310
Sure.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.310
Here we go.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.060
Say cheese!

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.940
Yeah!

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:07.270
I see there's something I can get stuck into right away.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:08.730
And I don't mean anything weird by that.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.070
Snippy-snappy!

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.910
Ousai Academy Student Council Rules:

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.620
article two, clause eight!

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.460
Make sure your pads are
small enough to go unnoticed!

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:26.880
Jesus!

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:27.340
Do you know what cherry-blossoms symbolize?

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.470
Prez! They're sticking out!

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.270
Oops.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:06.390
Good thing I wore a skirt!

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:08.310
Not even a refreshing scene can stay on track.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.020
Tsuda-kun.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:13.730
Yes?

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.860
Could you rub some sunscreen on me?

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.040
Calm down.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.540
At times like these, you've gotta recite pi
and recover your presence of mind!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.040
3.14...

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.290
Oh, that's all I know!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.510
Thank you.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.720
I'll rub some on you in return.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:44.810
Thanks.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.980
There!

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:49.940
Whoa! That looks nice!

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.940
Swim, swim, swim, swim!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.940
An azure sky, the azure sea...

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:58.950
I don't want to fight if it means
I have to hurt people!

00:03:59.360 --> 00:03:59.990
What?

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.450
I tried acting self-azured.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:04.330
Teams, hang in there!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.040
Take that!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.250
We lost!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.670
This sucks!

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:15.040
Come on, it was just a game.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.630
W-Were you just playing around with me?!

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.300
Hey, keep it down!

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:21.890
Gangway!

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:23.550
'Scuse me!

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:26.060
Sorry 'bout this!

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.560
A beach cruiser!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.070
It's been a year!

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.210
It's gotten a bit chilly.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.590
I should wear something on top.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:00.010
That'd just give people the wrong idea.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.590
That's not helping at all.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.850
I'm starting to feel cold too.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.350
Might be time to call it a day.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.140
Shall we head back to the inn, then?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:13.560
Ms. Yokoshima...

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:19.860
Not this year too!

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.860
Who's in charge here?!

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.530
What'd you think of the water?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:28.870
It was nice and shallow.

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.870
Looks like we can make a nice report, then.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.130
Anyway, we're going to be
staying at a lodging house.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.590
Try not to mess with anything in the room, you hear me?

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:41.380
We won't. We're not kids anymore.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:42.880
Especially the talismans.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.880
Huh?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.180
Well, everyone.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.970
Nighttime is upon us.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:52.890
We will now hold the traditional seaside
school event: the test of courage...

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.980
...preliminary inspection!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.770
Prez!

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.070
I believe it is time for good kids to go to sleep!

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:01.650
You're so naïve, Hagimura.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:05.660
At nighttime, the badder you are,
the greater your feminine charms.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.530
Pretty sure the great majority of people have never heard of that.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.170
Nothing to be afraid of...

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.710
It's so dark.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.050
Better watch your step.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.640
But this is surprisingly normal, huh?

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:30.310
Well, yeah, it's a normal promenade.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.310
Nothing to be afraid of...
Nothing wrong with normal.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:36.560
These things are all about
enjoying the atmosphere.
Nothing to be afraid of...

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:41.440
Does that apply to porn movies in which the actress plays a high schooler despite clearly not being one?

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.860
Tsuda places more emphasis on the situation.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:45.320
I heard that.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.200
Nothing to be afraid of...

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.080
Eek! T-Tsuda!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.790
Stooping like this is really hard.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.080
Hang in there.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:03.960
This might not be the most
appropriate time to say this,

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.340
but I love how nice and cool it is right now.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:08.890
The air's so fresh.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:09.720
Yeah.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.430
There's a certain charm to these insect cries, too.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.890
Really helps you relax, doesn't it?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.600
C-Cries?!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.020
Ahh! Ahh! I can't hear anything!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.980
One of us is totally on edge here!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:28.070
This will be the finish line, I guess?

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.240
What a wonderful shrine.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.450
Since we're here, why not take a picture?

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.040
Tsuda, if you could.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.000
Okay, okay.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.250
Just one "okay" is enough.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.540
Okay.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:43.750
I mean, even sighs end up
sounding lewd if you do it twice.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.260
Nah, I don't get it.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.010
I'm beat.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.260
In the end, we never did find anything.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.720
Of course we wouldn't.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:56.430
Anyway, it's getting late.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.520
We should hurry—

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.020
What in the world?

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.650
Could it be a ghost?!

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.860
Huh? Where's Hagimura?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:09.280
She said something about the night being young
and went to have another bath.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:16.740
What? A stag beetle?

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:20.870
So it was just the sound of an insect smacking against the window, attracted by the light?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:24.380
I was actually scared for a moment there!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.840
I should let Suzu-senpai know.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:31.510
Hello?

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.350
Quit laughing first!

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.470
Wait, there's a hole in the door.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.190
Apparently it's always been there.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:44.020
That's what the manager said.

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.150
Oh well.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.610
Taka-nii! Try peeping through this hole!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.110
Doesn't it make you feel like a voyeur?

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:52.610
<i>That's</i> the punchline?

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:57.830
The water's too hot, Mom!

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.790
What are you talking about?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.290
Take a look at that lady over there.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.670
She's in all the way to her shoulders.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.880
Well, I <i>am</i> a lady.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:06.750
See?

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:10.720
Sorry to ask, but could you call me
a lady one more time?

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:11.130
Huh?

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.090
Suzu-chan.

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.760
Shichijou-senpai.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:16.680
Mind if I join you?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.140
Not at all.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.390
Sorry about this.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.810
I forgot to take off my chastity belt.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:26.400
Aw, you're so naughty!

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.900
There's a summer festival nearby?

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.610
Nah. I'll pass.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.530
I'll be kicking back and enjoying myself.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.530
What about Ms. Yokoshima?

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:40.080
She's really enjoying herself in her room.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.040
Whoa! Don't you think
you're making it sound weird?

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.330
Wow, they're in full swing!

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.420
There are all kinds of stalls here.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:52.340
Experiences like these can help us in planning out school festivals.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:55.840
Let's check out this festival from
the viewpoint of the student council.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:56.430
Okay.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.550
15 minutes later

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:01.060
This is the student council viewpoint?

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:03.730
Well, we've gotta have fun!

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:05.480
Not you too.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.230
A shooting gallery!

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.770
Why don't we all square off against each other?

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.110
Fine by me.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:12.900
Excuse me!

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.070
For six people, please!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.070
Don't you mean five people?

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:18.990
Wait, is there an invisible person here?!

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:23.750
One, two...

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.170
Her left gun isn't hitting anything.
One, two...

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:26.830
One, two...

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.550
This is harder than it looks.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.920
Shino-chan.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.930
At times like these, you need to pump yourself up by yelling.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.090
Like what?

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.840
Well...

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.350
Ooh, I'm gonna shoot!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.600
Ooh, I'm gonna shoot!

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.270
Wow, you sure shot a lot!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.110
Cease fire at once!

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.740
The fireworks show has started!

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:58.610
Wow! Fantastic!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.370
Ooh!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:01.410
Fantas—

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:07.210
I remember the sound of the fireworks drowning out my voice the other time.

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.500
In that case, I might as well...

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.590
Testicles!

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:12.000
Great job! Well done!

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.260
Shall we take a picture to mark the occasion?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.380
Sounds good.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.630
Here we go.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:25.600
Oops. I ended up making a lewd hand sign.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.890
Damn it. I would've ignored that
if she hadn't brought it up.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:32.940
Okay.

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.400
We should turn in now.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:36.150
'Night.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.400
Guess I'm used to it now.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:39.200
Taka-nii!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.450
Don't get any strange ideas, all right?

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.780
I won't! I'll be sleeping at a distance, anyway.

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:45.870
Strange ideas?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:51.630
Like wanting us to accidentally step on him
when we go to the bathroom late at night.

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.590
I'd say that's pretty normal, Aria.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.300
Keep it together, guys!

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.260
Prez.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.470
Won't that yo-yo balloon leak water?

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:02.800
It'll be fine.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:03.970
I'm turning off the lights.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:06.060
Okay.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.320
Why is there a clit cap here?

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.330
There she goes with her nonsense again.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.830
You guys were a real help.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.790
Now I can relax and wait for
the second term to roll around.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.330
The second term?!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.170
What do I do about my homework?

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:38.300
You're so...

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.470
Wait, I guess I'm not one to talk.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:46.010
This has been a busy summer,
so I've been lagging behind too.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:47.720
In that case,

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.980
let's hold a study group, shall we?

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.480
The next day

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:52.980
Where's Kotomi?

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.230
She ran away.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.320
Here's something cool to drink for all of you.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:06.780
So good!

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:09.660
Is it hard to tell that I have nothing
but an apron covering my lower body?

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.870
Oh, I knew, but I ignored it.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.520
Does she want to teach me or something?

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:36.230
Is this the wingless fan
that's been all the rage lately?

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:36.900
Yeah.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.400
It <i>does</i> actually cool you down.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.280
What are you talking about?

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.030
How "wingless" is the in thing now.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.370
But the ones with wings
are easier to fix in place.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.040
I'm sorry I wasn't specific enough!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.000
Prez.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.630
What are you reading?

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.090
Oh, this?

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.550
Something to write a book report on.

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:02.550
Thick!

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:06.050
You haven't written one yet either, right?

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.800
Want me to lend you a good book?

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:10.510
I guess.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.930
Something thin and pleasurable.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.480
A book report on a porn fanzine?

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.520
How ingenious!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.940
What? Did I say something weird right now?

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.070
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.780
We have Pasta alla Genovese and Gazpacho soup for lunch.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.580
Tsuda!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:34.500
You're insulting Dejima-san by sniffing like that.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.710
I'm sorry.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:38.920
I've never seen these food items before,
so I couldn't help myself.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.710
I don't mind.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:45.880
After all, I sniffed the panties
in the laundry bag earlier too.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.720
People would totally mind that.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.850
No... real... solution.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.730
I'm done with my math homework!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:57.350
Congrats!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.940
Oh, it was just clapping?

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.700
And here I thought it was the sound of
hips smacking against each other.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.740
Sheesh. Talk about misleading.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.490
Did she just get mad at us?

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.120
All right! I think I can make it in time!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.250
Tsuda-kun, not getting much sleep?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.090
I bet you're leading a slovenly lifestyle.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.880
I'll give you morning calls from now on!

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:28.630
Good morning.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:29.840
Go to sleep.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:30.510
Okay.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:35.390
Takatoshi and Dried Squid: Max Power!

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.180
That's...

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:39.730
I have no idea!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:41.560
Yogurt?

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.270
Doesn't look like it.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.030
Did you lie to me?

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:47.280
I did not!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:47.950
This must be...

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.450
some kind of mistake.

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:55.580
Hang on, Hagimura!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:56.790
Here me out!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:57.660
Calm down—

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.210
It's all over.

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:07.420
So hot...

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:09.260
Talk about a sultry night.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.890
I can't sleep at all.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.720
I wonder what everyone else is up to.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.510
Tsuda, for one.

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:19.060
I felt like hearing your
moaning voice all of a sudden.

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:21.520
Did you <i>have</i> to say "moaning"?

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.900
It really is hot, though.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.650
We'd better keep up our water intake.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.450
And electrolytes too.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:36.740
Excessive electrolyte intake will
result in high blood pressure, so don't.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:37.660
Huh?

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.920
What you said only applies when you're doing strenuous exercise.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:47.800
It's kinda shocking to find out what you thought was common knowledge is actually wrong.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.670
Yeah.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.720
Like how idols and scat are actually unrelated.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.090
That's a bit too deep for me.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:58.470
That reminds me, there's a picture I'd like you to see.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:16:59.980
Okay. What is it?

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:05.360
Kotomi sent it to me, saying it was a picture of you as a baby.

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.980
What? She did?

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:12.360
Don't you think it's too big?

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:15.570
Prez.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:16.620
What?

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.330
I need to talk to Kotomi.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.160
Mind if I hang up?

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:23.210
Oh, were you in the middle of something?

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.000
I'm sorry.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.380
Don't be.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:26.960
Talk to you later.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.420
Good night.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:29.630
Night.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.260
I wonder what Hagimura's up to.

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.680
Prez?

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:37.930
Good evening.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.640
Yes. I'm awake.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:44.310
My friends are staying over at my place
to catch up on their summer homework,

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.020
and I'm supervising them.

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:50.650
By the way, we'll be walking Boa after this.

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.900
Didn't you mention that you
walk your dog early morning?

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:56.620
Not at this time of the year.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.870
People mistake me for a grade schooler doing radio exercises.

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:00.660
I see.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.370
Sorry to disturb you.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:05.460
Tell the two of them I said hi.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:07.000
Will do.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.670
Night.

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:09.800
Good night.

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:16.140
Hey! Quit dozing off!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.760
Sorry. I'm as terrible at studying as always.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:22.100
Mutsumi-chan.

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.640
Want something to keep you awake?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.060
What? You have something?

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.190
You stick that in,

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:31.860
and if you ever fall asleep,
Suzu-chan will switch it on!

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:34.450
Don't be ridiculous.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:37.740
It's better to get some fresh air if you want to wake up fully.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.450
Nice! Very nice, Mutsumi!

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:39.490
I brought it because I thought it'd help...

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:41.870
sniff
I brought it because I thought it'd help...

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:41.950
Don't get so depressed.
sniff

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.200
Don't get so depressed.

