Then let <i>it</i> touch you as well!

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:50.340
Spare us.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.210
Cute!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.590
Can I pet him?

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.090
