00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:20.620
I'm still feeling kind of hot.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.950
Oh, right. I forgot to switch it off.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:24.240
Switch what off?

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.500
Her morals.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.790
Oh, Shino-chan?

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:29.630
