00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.460
Right now?

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.000
Sure.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:38.010
Yeah, it's too hot for me to sleep, too.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:41.640
I'm dripping with sweat, even at this late hour.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:46.270
Oh, but that wasn't a sexual
